METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Damn Yankees
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/New_York
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2199527
DTSTAMP:20261016T215921Z
DTSTART:20270325T000000Z
DTEND:20270325T000000Z
SUMMARY:Damn Yankees
LOCATION:Marquis Theatre, 210 West 46 Street, New York NY 10036
DESCRIPTION:<p>Tony and Emmy Award winner Neil Patrick Harris, Emmy Award
  winner Julianne Hough, and Hamilton star Austin Scott come together in
  Tony Award winner Sergio Trujillo&rsquo;s &ldquo;damn-near-perfect
  reinvention&rdquo; (<em>The Washington Post</em>) of <em>Damn
  Yankees</em>. Named one of the Best of the Year by <em>The Washington
  Post</em>, this American favorite is back home for the first time in 30
  years. But never like this.<br /><br />What if you could have it all?
  Youth. Talent. Glory. For one average Joe, the chance to become
  baseball&rsquo;s hottest new star is suddenly within reach. But when a
  deal too good to be true collides with a temptation he never saw coming,
  the life of his dreams could cost him everything he truly loves.<br /><br
  />Irresistible music. Breathtaking dance. The white-hot thrill of the
  game. Give in to the spectacular rush of <em>Damn Yankees</em>.<br /><br
  />Just remember&hellip; to keep your soul, you gotta have heart.</p>
END:VEVENT
